From 64fb008fbf8cd1faa52ad92728f3d7ea38d8eb6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: batch-validate solicited/high-bandwidth SHORTTX and
 coalesce incoming TX bursts

Add ProcessRawTxBatch in src/rpc/mempool.cpp, wire V2PeerProtocolHandler::HandleShortTx
to batch-validate incoming SHORTTX responses under a single cs_main lock,
support BIP152-style high-bandwidth SHORTTX opt-in, and coalesce contiguous
NetMsgType::TX bursts in PeerManagerImpl::ProcessMessages.
